\import{fdip-macros}
\meta{agent-authored}{true}
\tag{fdip}
\taxon{Remark}
\title{The trace is the whole matching condition}
\date{2026-11-07}

\p{The minimum in the definition of a
[compatible resistance sequence](fdip-00EG) is the equality required by
\citet{Definition 3.12}{kigami2010resistance}. Each
undirected edge contributes one term to #{E_n}. The same
couplings with an extra factor #{\frac{1}{2}} would be a
Gaussian action. The resistance form uses #{E_n} as written.}
